A red LED is connected to pin D9 with a resistor. What does the LED do when this sketch runs?

```
void setup() {
  pinMode(9, OUTPUT);
}

void loop() {
  analogWrite(9, 0);
  delay(500);
  analogWrite(9, 255);
  delay(500);
}
```

A potentiometer is on A0 and an LED on D9. When you turn the pot, the LED brightness does not rise smoothly as expected. Which line is wrong?

```
void setup() {
  pinMode(9, OUTPUT);
}

void loop() {
  int okunan = analogRead(A0);
  analogWrite(9, okunan);
  delay(10);
}
```
